{
 "about": "Config for scripts/check_no_copyrighted.py. Terms are distinctive strings from the copyrighted Dana Point permit set (firm names, job / package / permit numbers, the project name). The set was retired from the app on 2026-11-14 (local copies may still exist outside the repo), so the terms stay: they keep anything derived from it out of git. term_allowlist names files allowed to carry a term because they document the guard or the retirement; image_allowlist pins synthetic images by blob sha.",
